  "name": "AP – Demo processing",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note-demo-processing",
      "name": "Note: Demo processing",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## Demo processing\nProcesses one file a visitor queued on the **public demo page** (a sample or an upload).\n\nThe page stores the file in the database and calls the webhook with its **ID only**: the webhook is reachable on the internal Docker network only. The **core service** does all the work, exactly as for the other channels, inside the visitor's session: limits, OCR budget, checks, duplicates within the session. Nothing is posted to QuickBooks: a ready invoice gets a **bill preview**.",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 1380
      },
      "position": [
        -40,
        -150
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-receive",
      "name": "Note: Receive",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Receive\nFrom the demo page (header **X-Demo-Key**, answered 202 at once) or from the clean-up, for a file still queued after a minute.",
        "height": 550,
        "width": 420
      },
      "position": [
        -40,
        250
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-process-core",
      "name": "Note: Process (core)",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Process (core)\nExtract, normalize, check, store, in the visitor's session. The core records this run with the session: its record is deleted when the session ends.",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 420
      },
      "position": [
        440,
        250
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-outcome",
      "name": "Note: Outcome",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Outcome\nThe demo page shows the result; nothing else to do here.",
        "height": 950,
        "width": 420
      },
      "position": [
        920,
        250
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-not-processed",
      "name": "Note: Not processed",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "content": "## Not processed\nNo answer, a server error, or a file that isn't waiting (409): the run fails and the error workflow logs it. The demo page shows the file as failed when the core recorded why.",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 420
      },
      "position": [
        -40,
        850
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "Demo webhook key"
        }
      },
      "id": "queued-file-webhook",
      "name": "Queued file (webhook)",
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "options": {
          "noResponseBody": true
        },
        "path": "ap-demo-upload",
        "responseCode": 202,
        "responseMode": "onReceived"
      },
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "webhookId": "49a9b6d7-4935-4e23-860f-e18e627ddc7e"
    },
    {
      "id": "missed-file-clean-up",
      "name": "Missed file (clean-up)",
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "position": [
        0,
        600
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "upload-id",
      "name": "Upload ID",
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "upload_id",
              "name": "upload_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body?.upload_id ?? $json.upload_id ?? '') }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "mode": "manual",
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        240,
        400
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "AP core token"
        }
      },
      "id": "process-upload-core",
      "maxTries": 3,
      "name": "Process upload (core)",
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ execution_id: $execution.id }) }}",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          },
          "timeout": 300000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "url": "=http://core:8000/demo/uploads/{{ $json.upload_id }}/process"
      },
      "position": [
        480,
        400
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "id": "route-by-status",
      "name": "Route by status",
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "error"
        },
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "ready",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode === 200 && $json.body.status === 'ready' }}",
                    "operator": {
                      "operation": "true",
                      "singleValue": true,
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "rightValue": ""
                  }
                ],
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                }
              },
              "outputKey": "ready",
              "renameOutput": true
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "needs_review",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode === 200 && $json.body.status === 'needs_review' }}",
                    "operator": {
                      "operation": "true",
                      "singleValue": true,
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "rightValue": ""
                  }
                ],
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                }
              },
              "outputKey": "needs_review",
              "renameOutput": true
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "rejected",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode === 200 && $json.body.status === 'rejected' }}",
                    "operator": {
                      "operation": "true",
                      "singleValue": true,
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "rightValue": ""
                  }
                ],
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                }
              },
              "outputKey": "rejected",
              "renameOutput": true
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "refused",
                    "leftValue": "={{ [413, 415].includes($json.statusCode) }}",
                    "operator": {
                      "operation": "true",
                      "singleValue": true,
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "rightValue": ""
                  }
                ],
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                }
              },
              "outputKey": "refused",
              "renameOutput": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "position": [
        720,
        400
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "ready-bill-preview-kept",
      "name": "Ready: bill preview kept",
